形。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "具有加强条件的范畴。", "source_term": "category fibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚纤维范畴"}, {"context": "对象所在的底。", "source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"context": "待考察通用性的纤维范畴对象。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "仿射概形相对于底的性质。", "source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"context": "不具有通用性的位置。", "source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"context": "在指定点不满足的形变论性质。", "source_term": "versal", "target_term": "通用的"}, {"context": "引理所构造及排除的态射。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "构造的态射须满足的第一项性质。", "source_term": "first order thickening", "target_term": "一阶加厚"}, {"context": "构造须满足的第二项性质。", "source_term": "short exact sequence", "target_term": "短正合列"}, {"context": "被排除的配对的第一项。", "source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"context": "被排除的配对须满足的相容条件。", "source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"context": "受保护数学片段之间的自然语言。", "source_term": "restriction of", "target_term": "的限制"}, {"context": "复合须等于的指定态射。", "source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}]}
